  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the United Nations Economic Commission for Africa (UNECA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the continental trade component (Pillar 2) of the Danish Africa Partnership for Peace and Sustainability (APPS). It relates also to Pillar 3 of the APPS on climate and energy, and will contribute to Pillar 1 (Peace, Security &amp; Governance) through its effects on reducing some of the factors (for instance poverty and unemployment) underpinning conflict. The project is a continuation of previous support from Denmark to the continental trade area (2019-2024) and includes an increased focus on green and blue economies and implementation at AU member states level in the context of the AfCFTA.</narrative>
  </description>
